1
00:00:00,161 --> 00:00:02,501
(Leonard:)We're here to see Koothrappali,
not kill Batman.

2
00:00:04,499 --> 00:00:06,789
(Howard:)Try less teeth.

3
00:00:11,631 --> 00:00:13,921
(Leonard:)Close enough. Come on.

4
00:00:15,885 --> 00:00:18,055
- Hey, Raj.
- Hey, guys. What's up?

5
00:00:18,221 --> 00:00:20,351
We wanted to invite you
out to dinner tonight.

6
00:00:20,515 --> 00:00:24,645
Celebrate your 30 Under 30 thing.
Right, Sheldon?

7
00:00:28,189 --> 00:00:30,899
- It's very nice of you. I would like that.
- Hello, boys.

8
00:00:31,067 --> 00:00:32,737
- Dr. Gablehauser.
- Dr. Koothrappali.

9
00:00:32,902 --> 00:00:34,442
- Dr. Gablehauser.
- Dr. Hofstadter.

10
00:00:34,612 --> 00:00:35,942
- Dr. Gablehauser.
- Dr. Cooper.

11
00:00:36,114 --> 00:00:39,244
- Dr. Gablehauser.
- Mr. Wolowitz.

12
00:00:40,034 --> 00:00:44,244
Boys, I got a question for you.
Who in this room discovered a star?

13
00:00:44,414 --> 00:00:47,294
Actually, 2008-NQ sub-17
is a planetary body.

14
00:00:47,458 --> 00:00:49,668
(Gablehauser:)I'm not talking about you,
I'm talking about me.

15
00:00:49,836 --> 00:00:54,506
(Gablehauser:)You, my exotic young friend, are my star.

16
00:00:54,674 --> 00:00:57,514
But you didn't discover him.
You merely noticed he was here...

17
00:00:57,677 --> 00:01:00,347
...much like he did with 2008-NQ sub-17.

